+## Try it on a real vault
+
+Walkthrough for the RFC 0003 / vanedb#198 demo slice:
+
+1. Install via [BRAT](https://github.com/TfTHacker/obsidian42-brat) → Add beta plugin → `vanedb/obsidian-vane-search` (or install a `0.2.0` release).
+2. On the machine running Obsidian: `ollama pull nomic-embed-text`.
+3. Settings → Vane Search → choose the **Ollama** preset (`http://localhost:11434/v1`, 768-d).
+4. Run **Index vault**, then open the search view and enter one semantic query about a note you know exists.
+5. Expect a top hit that matches the note by meaning (not an exact keyword match).
+
+This path is local-first: note text stays on your machine when using Ollama.
+
 ## Releasing (maintainers)
 
 Releases are cut by pushing a git tag that exactly matches `manifest.json`'s
